<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to reveal October federal tax receipts.</title>
<headline>Brazil to reveal October federal tax receipts.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Internal Revenue Service will reveal federal tax receipts for October at 1600 local/1800 GMT, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>September tax receipts were 8.049 billion reais, up from 7.436 billion in August and up 16.78 percent from September 1995, when the total was 6.892 billion reais.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia Newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
